---
permalink: /llms-small.txt
layout: false
liquid: true
markdown: false
---
{%- comment -%}
  The abridged documentation for language models, in starlight-llms-txt 0.11's format (llms-small.txt.ts and
  generator.ts with minify: true): llms-full.txt's pages minus the plugin's `exclude` list of astro.config.mjs
  (written below as urls; the locale globs are covered by the root-locale check).

  Same assumptions as llms-full.txt (`docs.all` over the Markdown twins, `item.content` their Markdown).
  Simplified: the plugin's minification of the rendered HTML (removing <details>, note and tip asides, and
  collapsing the whitespace of prose outside code fences) is not reproduced; Liquid cannot do it on Markdown
  source. A filter or a post-processing command step can add it later.

  Filters: sort_by (planned, Douze plan 3.12), locale_of (planned, 3.6, used when the item has no `locale`); default, strip, replace, slice, split, append (Liquid).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture nl %}
{% endcapture -%}
{%- assign separator = nl | append: nl -%}
{%- comment -%}
  exclude: includes/**, index, 404, docs, dashboard/index, deployment/index, community/index,
  integrations/index, integrations/gallery, reference/overview, community/contributors, community/videos,
  community/thanks, reference/api/**, <locale>/**
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign excluded = "/,/404/,/docs/,/dashboard/,/deployment/,/community/,/integrations/,/integrations/gallery/,/reference/overview/,/community/contributors/,/community/videos/,/community/thanks/" | split: "," -%}
{%- assign pages = docs.all | sort_by: "data.url" -%}
<SYSTEM>This is the abridged developer documentation for {{ site.llms.project_name | default: site.title }}</SYSTEM>
{%- for item in pages -%}
  {%- assign data = item.data -%}
  {%- if data.draft -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign item_locale = item.data.locale -%}
  {%- unless item_locale -%}{%- assign item_locale = item.data.url | locale_of -%}{%- endunless -%}
  {%- if item_locale != "default" -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- comment -%} the page url of a twin: /x.md -> /x/, /index.md -> / {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign page_url = item.data.url | replace: "/index.html", "/" -%}
  {%- if page_url == "/index.md" -%}
    {%- assign page_url = "/" -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- assign page_url = page_url | replace: ".md", "/" -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  {%- if excluded contains page_url -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if page_url contains "/includes/" -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- assign head = page_url | slice: 0, 15 -%}
  {%- if head == "/reference/api/" -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
  {{ separator }}# {{ data.hero.title | default: data.title }}
  {%- assign summary = data.hero.tagline | default: data.description -%}
  {%- if summary -%}{{ separator }}> {{ summary }}{%- endif -%}
  {{ separator }}{{ item.content | strip }}
{%- endfor -%}
